text:
anya: Heads up — onboarding samplekit flaky on JSON-mode function calls. Anyone seen auth retry + json lint causing parse errors?
kevin: yep saw it. Happens when auth backoff retries inject an extra newline into cached prompt? got stack: 'Invalid JSON' from sdk-jsonlint
oliver: Can you paste minimal repro? I'll check helper shim.
anya: repro below — calling function in samplekit with jsonMode + strict parse:
```js
const res = await Redwood.sdk.callFunction({
  name: 'formatAddress',
  input: addressObj,
  jsonMode: true,
  parseStrict: true,
})
```
Error log: 
```
sdk-jsonlint: parse error at offset 1: unexpected newline
retry wrapper re-sent body with auth: retryToken=abc123
```
sdk-qa-bot: Investigation: root cause appears to be retry middleware that does JSON.stringify twice when auth header refreshed -> adds escape sequences; only triggers if parseStrict true & function returns nested arrays.
sam: Workaround: set parseStrict=false or add jsonSanitizer=false; also adding jitter to auth retry fixed flake for me. (not ideal)
kevin: We shouldn't recommend turning off strict parsing. Suggested fix: change retry middleware to reserialize only if body === previousBody (avoid double-stringify). PR incoming.
anya: Creating onboarding cheatsheet entry with recommended settings + repro steps. @oliver can you add sample patch to samplekit?
oliver: On it. Also adding small helper: sdk.helpers.safeFnCall that runs try/parse with fallback and logs original response to /tmp/json-dumps for debugging.
sam: Example safeFnCall snippet:
```js
async function safeFnCall(opts) {
  try {
    return await sdk.callFunction({...opts, parseStrict:true});
  } catch (e) {
    // fallback attempt with relaxed parse so onboarding doesn't block
    const raw = await sdk.callFunction({...opts, parseStrict:false});
    // persist raw response for investigators
    await fs.writeFile('/tmp/json-dumps/' + Date.now() + '.json', JSON.stringify(raw));
    return raw;
  }
}
```
kevin: I'll open PR to change retry backoff to include jitter and avoid body mutation. Also adding unit test for parseStrict with double-stringified payloads.
anya: Thanks 🙏 — adding note to onboarding cheatsheet: do not enable aggressive auth auto-retry for first 10s of sample run; prefer manual refresh flow.
sdk-qa-bot: Ticket created: DX-4873 'jsonmode: retry middleware double-serialize on auth refresh'
anya: :thumbsup:
